# SOPS Git filters are intentionally disabled across this repo.
#
# Why: sops-nix and the guard at modules/.common.d/sops.nix use `builtins.readFile`
# on sources like modules/home-manager/ssh.d/keys.yaml at Nix evaluation time.
# If smudge decrypted those files in the worktree, eval would ingest plaintext
# secrets into /nix/store. The worktree MUST hold the encrypted form; runtime
# decryption is sops-nix's job at activation/service start, not git's.
#
# A source-of-truth assertion in modules/.common.d/sops.nix will fail evaluation
# if keys.yaml is found decrypted — treat that as a signal that filters were
# re-enabled by accident. Do not add `filter=sops-*` entries here.
